Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 08:43:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 26/49] S020 review: the reviewer's witnesses for the kept S020
 pieces become regression tests

From review/witness-s020 (REVIEW-s020.md), unchanged:
- internal/data/tree_metadata_witness_test.go: the metadata tree decoder
  against stock's on 17,842 trees, and the name leniency witness, which
  fails on S020's decoder and on S020 with the R7 patch, and passes here;
- internal/repository/index/listpacks_witness_test.go: the three listing
  paths against stock's loop on 472 selections, listings while the index
  grows, the count check on 400 states;
- internal/repository/prune_witness_test.go: 600 states against stock's
  packInfoFromIndex, and 13 real prunes checked with all data read;
- internal/repository/checker_pack_types_witness_test.go: the pack-type
  hints on 40 index sets.

restorer.go: a comment at the second-pass tree loader states that
LoadMetadataTree returns nodes without content IDs and that no
second-pass visitor may read Node.Content (review finding 8).

